        "native reranking candidates: [{\"document\":\"Memory reference date: 2023-03-26 (26 March 2023).\\nSource identity: locomo:conv-50:D2:17\\nCalvin: Got a new ride and wrote some new tunes - had a few studio sessions last week and I'm excited to collaborate. Can't wait to share it with everyone!\\nSource-ordered dialogue context:\\nNearby source turn for context only (earlier): Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Yeah, it was an incredible experience. So, anything new happening in your life?\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Dave: Cool, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing your new tunes. Keep me updated on how your collaborations go!\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Dave: Enjoy the collaborations, Calvin! Stay safe!\\n\",\"query\":\"What items did Calvin buy in March 2023?\",\"score\":0.5371114611625671},{\"document\":\"Memory reference date: 2023-03-26 (26 March 2023).\\nSource identity: locomo:conv-50:D2:1\\nCalvin: Hey Dave, been a few days, so I wanted to let you in on some cool news.  I just got a new car and it's amazing! Finally owning a luxury car was a dream come true and I'm so stoked.\\nSource-ordered dialogue context:\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Dave: Woohoo, Calvin! Congrats on the new car! How's it driving?\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Calvin: Nice car! It's an amazing ride - super smooth and real powerful. Like a rockstar behind the wheel! Thanks, man!\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Dave: Wow, Calvin! Owning something like this must feel amazing. Is this your first one? Show me a pic! What's it called?\\nNearby source turn for context only (later): Calvin: Woohoo! I finally got myself this beauty. Here's a pic from yesterday when I took it for a ride. Can't believe I'm actually driving it. Definitely what I deserve after all this hard work. Every time I step in, it's like an adrenaline rush!\\n\",\"query\":\"What items did Calvin buy in March 2023?\",\"score\":0.3667670786380768}]